   "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en-US\">\n<head><title>Upcoming Productions - Kauai Community Players Live Theatre</title></head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"main-content\"><div class=\"entry-content\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">PRODUCTIONS</h1></div>\n<div class=\"et_pb_with_border et_pb_section et_pb_section_2 et_section_regular\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_1\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_1 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h2 id=\"our-2027-season\">Our 2027 Season</h2></div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div><div class=\"et_pb_with_border et_pb_row et_pb_row_2 et_animated et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters1\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_2 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_0\">\n <a href=\"https://kauaicommunityplayers.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KCP_Come-From-Away.jpg\" class=\"et_pb_lightbox_image\" title=\"\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap \"></span></a>\n </div>\n </div><div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_4 et_pb_column_3 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h4><strong>Come from Away</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>Jan 8 – 31, 2027</strong></p>\n<p>Discover the jaw-dropping, heartwarming true story of the small town that welcomed the world. When 38 planes were grounded in a remote Canadian town on September 11, 2001, thousands of displaced travellers landed in the hearts of local residents. Filled with high energy, unforgettable music, and radical kindness, <em class=\"eujQNb\">Come From Away</em> will restore your faith in humanity.</p></div>\n </div><div class=\"et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_0_wrapper et_pb_module \">\n <a class=\"et_pb_button et_pb_button_0 et_pb_bg_layout_light\" href=\"https://kauaicommunityplayers.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Come-From-Away-audition-announcement.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">AUDITIONS</a>\n </div><div class=\"et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_1_wrapper et_pb_module \">\n <a class=\"et_pb_button et_pb_button_1 et_pb_bg_layout_light\" href=\"/cabaret-2/?eid=137687\">BUY TICKETS</a>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div><div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_3 et_animated et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters1\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_4 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_1\">\n <a href=\"https://kauaicommunityplayers.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KCP_Cemetery-Club.jpg\" class=\"et_pb_lightbox_image\" title=\"\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap \"></span></a>\n </div>\n </div><div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_4 et_pb_column_5 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h4><strong>Cemetery Club</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>Feb 26 – Mar 14, 2027</strong></p>\n<p><span class=\"gmail-\">The Cemetery Club</span> is a touching and funny play about three Jewish widows—Ida, Lucille, and Doris—who meet monthly for tea before visiting their husbands’ graves. When a handsome butcher named Sam enters the picture, their loyal friendship is tested as they face new beginnings, romance, and the challenges of aging. Hilarious and uplifting, you won’t want to miss this one.</p></div>\n </div><div class=\"et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_2_wrapper et_pb_module \">\n <a class=\"et_pb_button et_pb_button_2 et_pb_bg_layout_light\" href=\"/cabaret-2/?eid=137687\">BUY TICKETS</a>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div><div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_4 et_animated et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters1\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_6 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_2\">\n <a href=\"https://kauaicommunityplayers.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KCP_Death-of-a-Salseman.jpg\" class=\"et_pb_lightbox_image\" title=\"\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap \"></span></a>\n </div>\n </div><div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_4 et_pb_column_7 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h4><strong>Death of a Salesman</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>Apr 9 – 25, 2027</strong></p>\n<p>Arthur Miller’s<span> <em class=\"eujQNb\"><span class=\"gmail-iNqyIf\"><span class=\"gmail-jAOkJc\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\">Death of a Salesman</span></span></em></span> is a towering, Pulitzer Prize-winning masterpiece that stands as a definitive cornerstone of the modern theatrical canon. This shattering classic delivers an unsparing, eternal look into the human condition, tracking the brutal collapse of a man crushed by the weight of his own illusions. Come witness the timeless, heartbreaking downfall of Willy Loman live on stage.</p></div>\n </div><div class=\"et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_3_wrapper et_pb_module \">\n <a class=\"et_pb_button et_pb_button_3 et_pb_bg_layout_light\" href=\"https://kauaicommunityplayers.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Death-of-a-Saleman-Auditions.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">AUDITIONS</a>\n </div><div class=\"et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_4_wrapper et_pb_module \">\n <a class=\"et_pb_button et_pb_button_4 et_pb_bg_layout_light\" href=\"https://kauaicommunityplayers.org/cabaret-2/?eid=137687\">BUY TICKETS</a>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div><div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_5 et_animated et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters1\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_8 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_3\">\n <a href=\"https://kauaicommunityplayers.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/KCP-Sex-Please.jpg\" class=\"et_pb_lightbox_image\" title=\"\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap \"></span></a>\n </div>\n </div><div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_4 et_pb_column_9 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n <div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h4><strong>Sex Please, We’re 60</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>May 14 – 30, 2027</strong></p>\n<div>Brace yourself for this hilarious bedroom farce where wild mix-ups ignite, secrets unravel, and mistaken identities fuel an unforgettable night. While two older men employ their harebrained seduction schemes, four unstoppable women of “experience” show them how the game is really played. When passion and desire defy age, this heartwarming, laugh-out-loud comedy proves that romance later in life is full of surprises, especially when a few unexpected hot flashes turn up the heat.</div></div>\n </div><div class=\"et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_5_wrapper et_pb_module \">\n <a class=\"et_pb_button et_pb_button_5 et_pb_bg_layout_light\" href=\"https://kauaicommunityplayers.org/cabaret-2/?eid=137687\">BUY TICKETS</a>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</div></div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
  }
